---
title: "create_price_feeds (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: latest_only = state::assert_latest_only(pyth_state)
    q_version --> q_loop_check: !vector::is_empty(verified_vaas)
    q_loop_check --> q_pop: true
    q_loop_check --> q_destroy: false
    q_pop --> q_check_source: vaa = pop_back(verified_vaas)
    q_check_source --> q_abort_src: false, abort E_INVALID_DATA_SOURCE
    q_check_source --> q_deser: true, is_valid_data_source
    q_deser --> q_batch: price_infos = batch_price_attestation::deserialize(vaa_payload, clock)
    q_batch --> q_create: create_and_share_price_feeds(latest_only, pyth_state, price_infos, ctx)
    q_create --> q_loop_check
    q_destroy --> [*]: vector::destroy_empty(verified_vaas)

    note right of q_check_source
        INV-001: each VAA must originate from a registered data source
        INV-002: all VAAs must be processed; verified_vaas must be empty at exit
        INV-003: only latest contract version may invoke this function
    end note
